      "text": "dashed: the trainer's p (tail mass 0.08)\nfilled: ρ · p, rescaled to the sampler's\ntail mass: ρ = 0.06 / 0.08 = 0.75",
      "originalText": "dashed: the trainer's p (tail mass 0.08)\nfilled: ρ · p, rescaled to the sampler's\ntail mass: ρ = 0.06 / 0.08 = 0.75",
